urce":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"06321","municipality_pref":"山形県","municipality_name":"河北町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.30970128,38.41245021]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"一の滝","category":"nature","address":"河川景観 / 滝","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"06321","municipality_pref":"山形県","municipality_name":"河北町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"610"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.28924560546875,38.4433479309082]}}],"display_comment_original":"河北町周辺には、近世村の記憶として大町村、荒町村、新町村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場、城跡や陣屋跡に関わる場所が見え、谷地城跡、溝延城跡、畑中遺跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、大町村、荒町村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに田・新田・用水の地名が多く、土地改良碑や用水記念碑が見つかる可能性がある。水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["牧野寛索","田宮榮一","細谷雄二","細谷不句","新関良三"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["イベント","谷地どんが祭り（谷地八幡宮例祭）","谷地ひなまつり","べに花まつり","世界スリッパ卓球大会","谷地の舞楽（林家舞楽","観光地","児童動物園"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":["新庄藩","天領"],"heian_place_names":["寒河江荘","北寒河江荘"],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B2%B3%E5%8C%97%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q40034475","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11576503","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11606139","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11606140","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11504280","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11459938","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q96712371"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"河北町","wikipedia_revision_id":"110589650","wikidata_qid":"Q1347734","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B2%B3%E5%8C%97%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}